LITTLE NASTIES.

00:00:33.783 --> 00:00:34.951 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; UH --
&gt;&gt; THE VICTIM OF THE

00:00:34.951 --> 00:00:38.329
SUMMER'S BIGGEST HACK TURNS THE
TABLES WITH THE HELP OF TV'S

00:00:38.329 --> 00:00:41.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
