00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:55.305
&gt;&gt; IT'S A PUZZLE UNLIKE ANY HE'S
FACED BEFORE.

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:58.224
&gt;&gt; YO, DUDE, HOW YOU DOING OVER
