00:01:30.715 --> 00:01:34.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IT WAS "PASSWORD."
&gt;&gt; DAMN, YOU IS GOOD, DUDE.

00:01:34.677 --> 00:01:38.431
&gt;&gt; BUT YOU COULD BE GREAT IF YOU
DIDN'T LET YOUR EMOTIONS GET THE

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:42.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
