&gt;&gt; OH, WELL HELLO THERE.

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:46.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YOU CAN SEE MR. ROBOT?
&gt;&gt; SO IS THERE A MRS. ROBOT?

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:49.943
&gt;&gt; NO, HE'S A GHOST, HE'S DEAD.
&gt;&gt; I AIN'T AFRAID OF NO GHOST.

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:59.160
[ LAUGHTER ]
&gt;&gt; AND THE STARTLING CONCLUSION

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.913
&gt;&gt; AND THE STARTLING CONCLUSION
YOU WON'T BELIEVE.

00:02:01.913 --> 00:02:08.294
&gt;&gt; LESLIE, I FOUND YOUR HACKER.
